    "Looking straight at a worry can make it feel bigger at first. You don't have to solve it now. Its only job is to wait for Worry Time." : {
      "comment" : "Feedback response for a user who chose \"heavier\" for the \"How postponing felt\" question.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걱정을 똑바로 들여다보면 처음엔 더 크게 느껴질 수 있어요. 지금 해결하지 않아도 돼요. 이 걱정이 할 일은 걱정 시간까지 기다리는 것뿐이에요."
          }
        }
